<title>JAPAN: Nittoku Engineering - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nittoku Engineering - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.39		vs	    6.09</p>
<p> Operating	  429 million	 vs	  394 million</p>
<p> Current	    305 million	 vs	  251 million</p>
<p> Net		  192 million	 vs	  161 million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.15 yen	  vs	    8.52 yen</p>
<p> Shares		19 million	 vs	   19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nittoku Engineering Co Ltd is a leading manufacturer of automatic coil winding machines.</p>
